<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Usko says talks terminated.</title>
<headline>Usko says talks terminated.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics group Usko Ltd said on Friday that unspecified negotiations which it first announced in November had been terminated.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details in a brief statement which follows a similar announcement that it had ended talks by rival electronics group Omega Holdings Ltd on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
